<title>SWEDEN: Saab Aircraft says Tatra orders 2 planes.</title>
<headline>Saab Aircraft says Tatra orders 2 planes.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish aircraft maker Saab Aircraft said on Friday Slovakian airline Tatra Air ordered two SAAB 2000s.</p>
